; The recipe record's payload (tag 18, schema 1): format 1 (draft), SPEC.md section 12.
; CDDL by RFC 8610. The first rule is the one a payload is validated against; op-path and name-id
; are names.cddl's rules, and content-id is record.cddl's, read together with this file.
recipe = [owner: tstr, owner-schema: uint, op: op-path, version: uint, inputs: [* recipe-input], payload: bstr, outputs: [* content-id]]
recipe-input = [0, body: content-id] / [1, entity: name-id]
